<urn:usf:contract:atlas-capture-observer:2> <urn:usf:predicate:schemaPath> "schemas/atlas-capture-v2.schema.json" <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:contract:atlas-capture-observer:2> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "Use the existing three-carrier read-only extractor and temporary resource scope with truthful distinct controls. This successor preserves the prior definition/schema as historical source; version-one CPU-millisecond claims are not inherited or accepted as current observation." <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:contract:atlas-capture-observer:2> <urn:usf:predicate:requires> <urn:usf:requirement:atlas-capture-refusal:1> <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
